        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "capstone.md",
          "contents": "# APP PLAN\n\n## App Idea\nWhat is your app about? What problem does it solve?\n\n\n## Audience\nWho is this app for? Why does this problem matter to them?\n\n\n## Scope\nWhat will this version of your app include?\n\n\nWhat did you intentionally leave out? Why?\n\n\n## System\nDescribe one complete user interaction:\n- User action:\n- App decision or logic:\n- Result:\n\n\n**If your app uses external data (optional):**\n- Where does the data come from?\n- What happens while your app waits for it?\n- What happens if the data is unavailable or returns no results?\n\n\n-------------------------------\n\n# TESTING LOG\n\nWhat we tested:\n\n\nWhat happened:\n\n\nWhat we changed or decided because of the test:\n\n\n-------------------------------\n\n# AI USE LOG\n\nWhat we asked AI to help with:\n\n\nWhat we accepted, revised, or rejected — and why:\n\n\n-------------------------------\n\n# FEEDBACK LOG\n\nWho gave us feedback (peers, teachers, users, AI tools)?\n\n\nFeedback we received:\n\n\nWhat we changed based on feedback:\n\n\nWhat we chose not to change — and why:\n\n\n\n",
